<title>USA: HON sees furniture industry price pressure.</title>
<headline>HON sees furniture industry price pressure.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCATINE, Iowa 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hon Industries Inc said it expects continued consolidation of distribution within the office furniture industry, &quot;resulting in ongoing pricing pressures.&quot;</p>
<p>Shares in the maker and marketer of office furniture were off 1 to 40-1/2 after its announcement that third-quarter earnings were $0.60 per share versus $0.41 per share a year ago.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe our strong sales performance this quarter indicates we are gaining market share,&quot; said chief executive Jack Michaels.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
